>We have a small problem here with our version of Larn 12.0.  I won the
>game last night, sold everything I had, put it in the bank and went home
>to save the kid.  It put me down as a winner with ~875,000 points. (I
>know, I could have got alot more...)  I played after that, and it started
>me off with no weapons, armour, or gold, and no-one would do business
>with me, including the bank where I all of my 875,000 gold pieces.  What
>am I missing???  Sorry this is in net.sources.games, but there is no
>net.games.larn yet.  (Or is there?)
>
