>Greg.

	Not a bug, what you are suffering from is a condition know as
	"now that yo have played the game and won, you must pay the
	price".  You should have received voluminous mail when you won,
	congratulating you, and informing you that you owe taxes on
	your winnings.  Your bank account has been seized by the Larn
	Internal Revenu Service.  And a "feature" of larn is that once
	you have won a game at a lower difficulty level, you get to
	play it at the next difficulty level next time.  This is why
	you "go naked into the dungeon".  You can eventually find armor
	and weapons and gold, but till you pay off your taxes at the
	tax office (L on the surface), none of the stores are going to
	deal with you.  The pawn shop will buy things from you
	however.

	Hang in there.  There are 4 levels of difficulty!

	Kurt


